<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<GameData>
	<Language_en_US>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_GAME_OPTION_NO_TECH_TRADING">
			<Text>No Tech Trading</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_GAME_OPTION_NO_TECH_TRADING_HELP">
			<Text>Disables technology trade between civilizations.</Text>
		</Row>

		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_GAME_OPTION_RESEARCH_AGREEMENTS">
			<Text>Enable Research Agreements</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_GAME_OPTION_RESEARCH_AGREEMENTS_HELP">
			<Text>If enabled, you can sign Research Agreements with other civilizations.</Text>
		</Row>

		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_GAME_OPTION_NO_TECH_BROKERING">
			<Text>No Tech Brokering</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_GAME_OPTION_NO_TECH_BROKERING_HELP">
			<Text>If enabled, you cannot sell technology to another civilization unless you have researched that technology yourself.</Text>
		</Row>

		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_GAME_OPTION_NO_VASSALAGE">
			<Text>No Vassalage</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_GAME_OPTION_NO_VASSALAGE_HELP">
			<Text>Disables the Vassalage System. No vassals can be created.</Text>
		</Row>

		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_GAME_OPTION_PASSIVE_ESPIONAGE">
			<Text>Passive Espionage</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_GAME_OPTION_PASSIVE_ESPIONAGE_HELP">
			<Text>Disables Advanced Spy Missions. Spies only provide their passive benefits while stationed in a City. NOTE: This option does nothing if 'No Espionage' is enabled.</Text>
		</Row>
	</Language_en_US>
	<Language_zh_CN>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_GAME_OPTION_NO_TECH_TRADING">
			<Text>无科技交易</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_GAME_OPTION_NO_TECH_TRADING_HELP">
			<Text>阻碍文明之间的技术贸易。</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_GAME_OPTION_RESEARCH_AGREEMENTS">
			<Text>启用研究协议</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_GAME_OPTION_RESEARCH_AGREEMENTS_HELP">
			<Text>如果启用，您可以与其他文明签署研究协议。</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_GAME_OPTION_NO_TECH_BROKERING">
			<Text>无技术经纪</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_GAME_OPTION_NO_TECH_BROKERING_HELP">
			<Text>如果启用，您将无法将技术出售给另一个文明，除非您自己研究了该技术。</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_GAME_OPTION_NO_VASSALAGE">
			<Text>没有附庸</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_GAME_OPTION_NO_VASSALAGE_HELP">
			<Text>禁用附庸系统。无法创建封臣。</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_GAME_OPTION_PASSIVE_ESPIONAGE">
			<Text>被动间谍活动</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_GAME_OPTION_PASSIVE_ESPIONAGE_HELP">
			<Text>禁用高级间谍任务。间谍仅在驻扎在城市时提供被动利益。注意：如果启用“无间谍活动”，此选项不会执行任何操作。</Text>
		</Row>
	</Language_zh_CN>
</GameData>